# Written by `nix run .#cli-run` out of the rows. The rounds the VRT drives are
# kept, so a checkout runs the tests and a dev server with no CLI run behind it;
# the other twelve are 50MB the rows already say. COTA is kept on the strength of
# one tracker shot, and costs 1.8MB against Le Mans's 25MB of laps.
*.json
*.jsonl
!/index.json
!/2025/le_mans_24h.json
!/2025/le_mans_24h_laps.jsonl
!/2025/le_mans_24h_timeline.jsonl
!/2025/cota_6h.json
!/2025/cota_6h_laps.jsonl
!/2025/cota_6h_timeline.jsonl
